# generator: a 64-step pattern with a 64-bit turing loop: the live grid should use every slot
wait 300
turn ALGO 1
expect trk 2
pat 2 1 64
steps 2 1
tap ARP
turn SELECT 1
turn SELECT 1
expect page Generator
turn K1 1
turn K1 1
expect gen 2 1 2 16 50 50
turn K2 48
expect gen 2 1 2 64 50 50
tap PLAY
wait 9000
tap SEQ
wait 50
tap PLAY
shot generator_turing64_bar1.png
tap OCT+
wait 50
shot generator_turing64_bar2.png
tap OCT+
wait 50
shot generator_turing64_bar3.png
tap OCT+
wait 50
shot generator_turing64_bar4.png
# 64 steps, 64 bits: every bar carries live hits (the screenshots; ~40 % of the slots at density 50)
